      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 596,
      "ruku": 535,
      "hizbQuarter": 238,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 6082,
      "text": "your Lord has neither forsaken you [O Prophet] nor hated you;",
      "surah": {
        "number": 93,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الضُّحَىٰ",
        "englishName": "Ad-Dhuhaa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Morning Hours",
        "numberOfAyahs": 11,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 3,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 596,
      "ruku": 535,
      "hizbQuarter": 238,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 6083,
      "text": "the Hereafter is better for you than the present life;",
      "surah": {
        "number": 93,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الضُّحَىٰ",
        "englishName": "Ad-Dhuhaa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Morning Hours",
        "numberOfAyahs": 11,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 4,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 596,
      "ruku": 535,
      "hizbQuarter": 238,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 6084,
      "text": "and your Lord will certainly give you so much that you will be well pleased.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 93,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الضُّحَىٰ",
        "englishName": "Ad-Dhuhaa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Morning Hours",
        "numberOfAyahs": 11,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 5,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 596,
      "ruku": 535,
      "hizbQuarter": 238,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 6085,
      "text": "Did He not find you an orphan then take good care of you?",
      "surah": {
        "number": 93,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الضُّحَىٰ",
        "englishName": "Ad-Dhuhaa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Morning Hours",
        "numberOfAyahs": 11,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 6,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 596,
      "ruku": 535,
      "hizbQuarter": 238,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 6086,
      "text": "Did He not find you unguided then guide you?",
      "surah": {
        "number": 93,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الضُّحَىٰ",
        "englishName": "Ad-Dhuhaa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Morning Hours",
        "numberOfAyahs": 11,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 7,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 596,
      "ruku": 535,
      "hizbQuarter": 238,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 6087,
      "text": "Did He not find you in need then enrich you?",
      "surah": {
        "number": 93,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الضُّحَىٰ",
        "englishName": "Ad-Dhuhaa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Morning Hours",
        "numberOfAyahs": 11,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 8,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 596,
      "ruku": 535,
      "hizbQuarter": 238,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 6088,
      "text": "So do not mistreat the orphan,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 93,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الضُّحَىٰ",
        "englishName": "Ad-Dhuhaa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Morning Hours",
        "numberOfAyahs": 11,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 9,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 596,
      "ruku": 535,
      "hizbQuarter": 238,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
